# sec-fa schema contract format
#
# These files are line-oriented interface contracts. They are intended to be
# readable with less, diff, grep, cut, awk, and sort.
#
# Metadata rows:
#   schema<TAB>name
#   kind<TAB>event|record
#   version<TAB>integer
#
# Field rows:
#   field<TAB>path<TAB>presence<TAB>type<TAB>rules<TAB>notes
#
# presence is required or optional. rules is "-" when no additional rule is
# needed. Dotted paths describe nested payload fields.
#
# Example:
#   awk -F '\t' '$1 == "field" && $3 == "required" { print $2 }' docs/schemas/observation.schema
